        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29429549981227265,
        "y0": 0.49869786161562646,
        "x1": 0.8785445163272877,
        "y1": 0.5118107464049806
      },
      "text": "Daiyan Zahid and Ramna Safda achieved Credits.  In the Writing test Christina",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29429549981227265,
        "y0": 0.5169378706639549,
        "x1": 0.8926757359339698,
        "y1": 0.5300507554533092
      },
      "text": "LoGiudice achieved a High Distinction, Aimun Nauman and Henrissa Pama both",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29429549981227265,
        "y0": 0.535322145154294,
        "x1": 0.9154299194114482,
        "y1": 0.5484350299436481
      },
      "text": "achieved Distinctions and Anagha Janakiraman and Diayan Zahid achieved Credits.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29429549981227265,
        "y0": 0.5538506488390451,
        "x1": 0.861743239315817,
        "y1": 0.5669635336283991
      },
      "text": "Congratulations to all students who entered and participated in these tests.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942954741810339,
        "y0": 0.5839185030095163,
        "x1": 0.8821422451567539,
        "y1": 0.5970313877988704
      },
      "text": "This week a letter will be coming home to ask if you no longer require a paper",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942954741810339,
        "y0": 0.6021585120578448,
        "x1": 0.903895169923056,
        "y1": 0.615271396847199
      },
      "text": "edition of the weekly newsletter as you access it via the Prestons PS web page at",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29429549981227265,
        "y0": 0.6205815352309751,
        "x1": 0.5710372407053664,
        "y1": 0.6336944200203293
      },
      "text": "www.prestons-p.schools.nsw.edu.au",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5710542085854299,
        "y0": 0.6205815352309751,
        "x1": 0.8934714577414772,
        "y1": 0.6336944200203293
      },
      "text": ".  This will assist the school in lowering our",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942938850442304,
        "y0": 0.6389658097213142,
        "x1": 0.9322112296879199,
        "y1": 0.6520786945106682
      },
      "text": "carbon footprint as well as reducing printing costs. We thank you for your support in",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942938850442304,
        "y0": 0.6573500842116533,
        "x1": 0.3824365881512516,
        "y1": 0.6704629690010073
      },
      "text": "this matter.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942938850442304,
        "y0": 0.6874179383821244,
        "x1": 0.9243297262921621,
        "y1": 0.7005308231714786
      },
      "text": "Next week is Literacy Numeracy Week and the school has planned several engaging",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942938850442304,
        "y0": 0.7058021947486642,
        "x1": 0.878839813829117,
        "y1": 0.7189150795380184
      },
      "text": "student centred activities to celebrate including: Indigenous Book Swap; Mad",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2942938850442304,
        "y0": 0.7241864511152041,
        "x1": 0.9107922287002682,
        "y1": 0.7372993359045581
      },
      "text": "Hatter’s Picnic; Read-A-Thon; Literacy/Numeracy Fun Day. As well, we will also be",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.7425707074817438,
        "x1": 0.9382939327470414,
        "y1": 0.7556835922710979
      },
      "text": "celebrating Fruit and Vegetable Week at the same time. Mrs Beavis has planned daily",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.7608107346538716,
        "x1": 0.9075656658393805,
        "y1": 0.7739236194432257
      },
      "text": "activities during play breaks for students to participate. What an exciting week to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.7793392383386226,
        "x1": 0.4170224077557553,
        "y1": 0.7924521231279769
      },
      "text": "look forward to!",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.8094070925090939,
        "x1": 0.9182286712660838,
        "y1": 0.8225199772984481
      },
      "text": "The Principal’s Class of the Week Award goes to class 4BP who have demonstrated",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.8277913488756337,
        "x1": 0.816900643787821,
        "y1": 0.8409042336649879
      },
      "text": "fantastic behaviour and engagement in learning over the past weeks.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29427537928984093,
        "y0": 0.8461756143040731,
        "x1": 0.8632622746813163,
        "y1": 0.8592884990934273
      },
      "text": "Congratulations students, Mrs Boss and Mrs Bayley-Patton (class teachers).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
